                        "c": "Moderately available",
                        "d": "Specialized use"
                      },
                      {
                        "a": "ROI Potential",
                        "b": "Highest for full loads",
                        "c": "Strong for regional ops",
                        "d": "Best for flexible loads"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-at-a-glance-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Understanding the standard size of a dry van trailer is an important first step, but choosing the right equipment ultimately comes down to how your business operates. For most long-haul operations, the 53 ft dry van trailer continues to be the industry's preferred option because of its capacity and versatility. However, 48 ft and 28 ft dry van trailers still play an important role in specialized freight operations.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-at-a-glance-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The key is working with a dealership that understands the trucking industry and can help you choose equipment that fits your goals. At <a href=\"/locations/trailer-sales\">Sun State Trailers</a>, we're committed to providing straightforward guidance and dependable equipment so you can keep your business moving forward.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-3",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "width": "full",
                    "image": {
                      "src": "/img/blog/standard-size-of-a-dry-van-trailer/3.jpg",
                      "width": 1000,
                      "height": 667,
                      "alt": "Row of dry van trailers parked at Sun State Trailers dealership lot"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-ready-to-find-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you're searching for a 53 ft dry van trailer for sale, exploring 48 ft dry van trailers for sale, or considering a 28 ft dry van trailer for sale, the team at Sun State Trailers is here to help. Browse available equipment or speak with a local trailer specialist today. The right trailer can make a major difference in the efficiency and profitability of your fleet.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
